      "created_at": "2016-06-15T15:59:05Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-06-15T15:59:05Z",
      "body": "That's pretty simple actually, and the increase in privacy is obvious. For the exhaustiveness of the data, here is the idea: I don't think the size of my shared folders is no one business except mine. So, I don't want to send this information to data.syncthing.net, and I deactivate the usage report. However, if it would take mathematical commitment to preserve my privacy, I would be inclined to accept it. I guess more people would as well, and the stats would better represent the big picture.\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
