      "created_at": "2016-06-15T16:03:37Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-06-15T16:03:37Z",
      "body": "That there is a skew towards the features used by people who enable usage reporting is understood. For example this would be reflected in the fact that we're probably seeing less users who use only custom discovery servers, as these are likely to be users \"off the grid\" and thus not reporting usage data either. \n\nI fail to see the reporting of folder sizes as a privacy issue as we can't correlate it to \"you\" in any way. If you think it is, you are of course entirely welcome to not report usage stats, that's why we ask in the first place. :)\n",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
